# Copy to .env and fill in the Client UUID/Secret ActBlue issues for each
# entity's CSV API access (Settings > CSV API on that entity's ActBlue
# dashboard). One pair per account `key` listed in accounts.yaml, named
# ACTBLUE_<KEY>_CLIENT_UUID / ACTBLUE_<KEY>_CLIENT_SECRET.
